- Published: 2013-06-12
- Modified: 2025-10-13
- URL: https://80000hours.org/2013/06/where-can-i-earn-the-most/
- Topics: Advice for undergraduates, Career advice &amp; strategy, Career paths, Career planning, Doing good in your current job, Earning to give, Income, Other topics, Personal fit, Skill-building and career capital
Since one way that you can have a big impact with your career is through earning to give, we want to investigate which careers hold the best earnings prospects. Our most recent research looked at the typical career paths and salaries for five different careers: Accounting, Consulting, Investment Banking, Law and Medicine. We found that investment bankers have the highest earning potential and in the UK: they can expect to earn between £8m and £40m over the course of their career.

