Recently we (/2013/04/interview-with-holden-karnofsky-co-founder-of-givewell/), co-founder of the independent, nonprofit charity evaluator (http://www.givewell.org/). We recommend GiveWell as a leading source of information on where to have the largest impact with your charitable donations. Our conversation suggested that GiveWell might be one of the highest impact career opportunities in the world. There's reason to think that GiveWell has the potential to be an extremely impactful organisation, but they are short of some key types of staff. If you fit their criteria, then this is a position really worth considering. Read on for excerpts from our conversation on (i) what GiveWell does and why it's important (ii) what kind of people will do well there (iii) how you can get a job there.

